{"id":"ba35738413a412b8","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement.md","title":"Theorem — 双拷贝胶合与子对象的补","display":"Theorem — 双拷贝胶合与子对象的补","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement","aliases":["14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement"],"display":"Theorem — 双拷贝胶合与子对象的补","source_ref":"VI exercises, Exercise16(c)–(d), printed p.346, DjVu179 left","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]","[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 双拷贝胶合与子对象的补"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"VI exercises, Exercise16(c)–(d), printed p.346, DjVu179 left"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0f4ff76187675015\" href=\"?note=0f4ff76187675015\" title=\"14-df-split-coequalizer\">14-df-split-coequalizer</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f584a450845e8d6\" href=\"?note=4f584a450845e8d6\" title=\"14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits\">14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A\\hookrightarrow E\">\\(m:A\\hookrightarrow E\\)</span> 为任意单态射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=E+E\">\\(B=E+E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_0,i_1:E\\to B\">\\(i_0,i_1:E\\to B\\)</span> 为余积嵌入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2=1+1\">\\(2=1+1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_0,\\kappa_1:1\\to2\">\\(\\kappa_0,\\kappa_1:1\\to2\\)</span> 为余积嵌入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:B\\to Q\">\\(q:B\\to Q\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_0m,i_1m\">\\(i_0m,i_1m\\)</span> 的选定余等化子，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0f4ff76187675015\" href=\"?note=0f4ff76187675015\" title=\"14-df-split-coequalizer\">14-df-split-coequalizer</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal E}(q,i_0m,i_1m)\">\\(\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal E}(q,i_0m,i_1m)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:Q\\to B\">\\(s:Q\\to B\\)</span> 为候选截面，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Im}\">\\(\\operatorname{Im}\\)</span> 是像子对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,d_2,D_2,C_s\">\\(t,d_2,D_2,C_s\\)</span> 为下式新构造；两个余积诱导箭头均用所选余积嵌入及存在唯一性定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal E}(q,i_0\\circ m,i_1\\circ m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal E}(q,i_0\\circ m,i_1\\circ m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,2)\\quad v\\circ i_0=\\kappa_0\\circ!_E\\land v\\circ i_1=\\kappa_1\\circ!_E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,2)\\quad v\\circ i_0=\\kappa_0\\circ!_E\\land v\\circ i_1=\\kappa_1\\circ!_E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t:=\\iota v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,2)\\;\\left(v\\circ i_0=\\kappa_0\\circ!_E\\land v\\circ i_1=\\kappa_1\\circ!_E\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t:=\\iota v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,2)\\;\\left(v\\circ i_0=\\kappa_0\\circ!_E\\land v\\circ i_1=\\kappa_1\\circ!_E\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(2,2\\times2)\\quad w\\circ\\kappa_0=\\langle\\kappa_0,\\kappa_1\\rangle\\land w\\circ\\kappa_1=\\langle\\kappa_1,\\kappa_0\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(2,2\\times2)\\quad w\\circ\\kappa_0=\\langle\\kappa_0,\\kappa_1\\rangle\\land w\\circ\\kappa_1=\\langle\\kappa_1,\\kappa_0\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_2:=\\iota w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(2,2\\times2)\\;\\left(w\\circ\\kappa_0=\\langle\\kappa_0,\\kappa_1\\rangle\\land w\\circ\\kappa_1=\\langle\\kappa_1,\\kappa_0\\rangle\\right),\\qquad D_2:=\\operatorname{Im}(d_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_2:=\\iota w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(2,2\\times2)\\;\\left(w\\circ\\kappa_0=\\langle\\kappa_0,\\kappa_1\\rangle\\land w\\circ\\kappa_1=\\langle\\kappa_1,\\kappa_0\\rangle\\right),\\qquad D_2:=\\operatorname{Im}(d_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_s:=\\langle t\\circ s\\circ q\\circ i_0,t\\circ s\\circ q\\circ i_1\\rangle^{-1}(D_2)\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_s:=\\langle t\\circ s\\circ q\\circ i_0,t\\circ s\\circ q\\circ i_1\\rangle^{-1}(D_2)\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsEpi}(q)\\land\\operatorname{IsEqualizer}_{\\mathcal E}(A,m,q\\circ i_0,q\\circ i_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsEpi}(q)\\land\\operatorname{IsEqualizer}_{\\mathcal E}(A,m,q\\circ i_0,q\\circ i_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s:Q\\to B\\quad\\bigl(q\\circ s=1_Q\\Rightarrow[m]\\wedge_E C_s=\\bot_E\\land[m]\\vee_E C_s=\\top_E\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s:Q\\to B\\quad\\bigl(q\\circ s=1_Q\\Rightarrow[m]\\wedge_E C_s=\\bot_E\\land[m]\\vee_E C_s=\\top_E\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按原书 VI 练习16(c)–(d)，印刷 p.346，DjVu179 左页；图像确认截面靶是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E+E\">\\(E+E\\)</span>，OCR 的乘号错误已排除。余等化子存在由有限余极限给出，且必为满态射。证明等化子：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\top!_E,\\chi_m]:E+E\\to\\Omega\">\\([\\top!_E,\\chi_m]:E+E\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 等化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_0m,i_1m\">\\(i_0m,i_1m\\)</span>，故经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 因子化。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"qi_0x=qi_1x\">\\(qi_0x=qi_1x\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top! =\\chi_mx\">\\(\\top! =\\chi_mx\\)</span>，分类子泛性质给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 唯一经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 因子化。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"qs=1\">\\(qs=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 也是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"sqi_0,sqi_1\">\\(sqi_0,sqi_1\\)</span> 的等化子。折叠 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[1_E,1_E]:B\\to E\">\\([1_E,1_E]:B\\to E\\)</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 因子化，所以这两个箭头都在原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 上。积与余积分配给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\cong E\\times2\">\\(B\\cong E\\times2\\)</span>，于是它们相等当且仅当其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 分量相等。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\times2\">\\(2\\times2\\)</span> 的四个不交余积分块中，两个相同标记块给对角，两个不同标记块给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_2\">\\(D_2\\)</span>；二者交为底、并为顶。拉回该分解即给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]\">\\([m]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s\">\\(C_s\\)</span> 互补。这对任意子对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 成立，而不限于终对象的子对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-split-coequalizer","status":"resolved","id":"0f4ff76187675015","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"4f584a450845e8d6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnch